    ],
    "description": "Given a sentence, convert it to 'Goat Latin': words starting with a vowel get 'ma' appended; words starting with a consonant have their first letter moved to the end plus 'ma'; then each word gets one additional trailing 'a' per its 1-indexed position in the sentence. Return the resulting sentence.",
